  "contentHtml": "<img src=\"https://mcusercontent.com/be20bbfba341582993786f7f0/images/6e143325-c7c7-37f3-3355-975fc53161bb.png\" width=\"628\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n<p><span>Hey Brew Shop Fam!<br>Here's an update of what's happening this week - from new&nbsp;beer drops, wine reviews, our current tap list, to upcoming tastings, and more.&nbsp;</span></p>\n<a href=\"https://us.list-manage.com/16GDE2r9NLC?e=01c6cdb4b7&amp;c2id=78b36ba273cb71acbb53a8fce08ea4f0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">SHOP THIS WEEK’S NEWSLETTER HERE</a>\n<a href=\"https://us.list-manage.com/1BL2lgkLtE_?e=01c6cdb4b7&amp;c2id=78b36ba273cb71acbb53a8fce08ea4f0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">SHOP OUR ENTIRE STOCK OF BEER, WINE &amp; HOMEBREW HERE</a>\n<img src=\"https://mcusercontent.com/be20bbfba341582993786f7f0/images/e7b0c123-d544-9ac7-2463-54632a08fc28.jpeg\" width=\"520\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n<p><span><span><span><span>Join us this</span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span> Friday from 5-7 PM</span></span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span> as we welcome</span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span>&nbsp;Blake’s Hard Ciders&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span>for our free tasting! Scroll down to the bottom of our newsletter to see the full line-up for September!</span></span></span></span></p>\n<img src=\"https://mcusercontent.com/be20bbfba341582993786f7f0/images/875da856-a0d8-af69-6866-64d74c79561b.png\" width=\"612\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n<p><span><span><span>Join us for an evening filled with books and wine with special guest </span></span></span><strong><span><span><span>The Wandering Shelf</span></span></span></strong><span><span><span>! </span></span><span><span>We’re creating a spin off from the beloved Scholastic Book Fair we attended as kids, with plenty of books on hand to go with our free wine tasting.</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>It’s our Wine Club pickup tasting and everyone is invited! </span></span></span><strong><span><span><span>Sip and browse</span></span></span></strong><span><span><span> a fun curation of books and bookish goods for adults (&amp; a few special goodies for your kids!) </span></span></span><strong><span><span><span>Tessa, owner of The Wandering Shelf</span></span></span></strong><span><span><span>, will be here to chat all things books with you while you check out what our Wine Club is all about with a </span></span></span><strong><span><span><span>free tasting</span></span></span></strong><span><span><span> of this month’s Wine Club wines. Wine Club Members get special discounts on books, and book purchasers get a chance at a free membership to our Wine Club! Come by anytime from </span></span></span><strong><span><span><span>5-8pm next Thursday, 9/24,</span></span></span></strong><span><span><span> and check it out!</span></span></span></p>\n<div class=\"reader-image-row reader-brew-grid\" data-columns=\"2\"><figure><img src=\"https://mcusercontent.com/be20bbfba341582993786f7f0/images/dd88a5c1-9ab8-7218-0702-3a9c6bb56f6b.jpeg\" width=\"298\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><p><span><span><span><span>🌽 We love </span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span>Wheatland Spring</span></span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span><br>•</span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span> Ursprung</span></span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span> Festbier<br>•</span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span> Farmers &amp; Neighbors</span></span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span> IPA<br>• </span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span>Spire City </span></span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span>Tmavé Pivo<br>• </span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span>Well Sown </span></span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span>Estate Lager<br>•